    },
    "notes": "I10. Seven actual stages each facing: parry first training blade, close step, second blade contact, withdrawal and mannequin blade drops, threat check, join/control weapon, genuine final STOW with both compact halves at hips and hands released. Source does not prescribe first/second hand: left parry then right strike is valid. Corrected left shield stays on near anatomical LEFT arm. QA approved final left stow3; unsafe upper0/1 never counted or played. Packing from joined staff to compact hips is an endpoint ellipse, no new equipment/inventory mechanic. Gray articulated mannequin is an explicit scene-study stand-in: no real opponent duplicated in combat, independent victim/lifecycle synchronization absent. No gore/projectile or renamed victory pose. One fixed Feral body reference per page, reviewed Feral-feet anchors exclude mannequin feet. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
